Problem Requirements
A valid serial number:
Starts with SN (case-sensitive)
Followed by exactly 4 digits
Then a hyphen (-)
Then exactly 4 digits
Must not be part of a larger word like ASN1234-5678
Must not have extra digits like SN1234-56789
Query:-

SELECT *
FROM products
WHERE REGEXP_LIKE(
        description, 
        '(^|[^A-Za-z0-9])SN[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{4}([^A-Za-z0-9]|$)',
        'c'
    )
ORDER BY product_id;

